(919,1677,$mw$EB8C96E3553810575C1F9E505D8D3FFAD72376D52880FFAFC2784C26E1146B5B$mw$,$mw$1923d5a428796da02055eeb69a9c11d4$mw$,$mw$$mw$,$mw${"Id":1677,"StageId":1,"CategoryId":81,"Points":10,"TitleAr":"على خط الأعداد توجد علامتان عند 340 و360. ما العدد الواقع في منتصف المسافة بينهما؟","TitleEn":"On a number line, two marks are at 340 and 360. What number is exactly halfway between them?","QuestionTextAr":"على خط الأعداد توجد علامتان عند 340 و360. ما العدد الواقع في منتصف المسافة بينهما؟","QuestionTextEn":"On a number line, two marks are at 340 and 360. What number is exactly halfway between them?","DetailedSolutionAr":"القانون المستخدم: قانون المنتصف على خط الأعداد: m=(a+b)/2.\n\nخطوات الحل: منتصف العددين هو متوسطهما: ‏(340+360)÷2 = 350، وهو يبعد 10 عن كل طرف.","DetailedSolutionEn":"Rule used: Number-line midpoint: m=(a+b)/2.\n\nSolution steps: The midpoint is the average (340+360)/2=350, ten units away from either endpoint.","YoutubeSolutionUrl":null,"EditorialDetailsJson":null,"Options":[{"Id":6697,"Order":1,"LatexCode":"345","IsCorrect":false},{"Id":6698,"Order":2,"LatexCode":"350","IsCorrect":true},{"Id":6699,"Order":3,"LatexCode":"355","IsCorrect":false},{"Id":6700,"Order":4,"LatexCode":"370","IsCorrect":false}]}$mw$::jsonb,$mw${"Hints":[{"Ar":"العدد المطلوب يبعد المسافة نفسها عن الطرفين.","En":"The desired number is equally far from both endpoints."},{"Ar":"احسب نصف المسافة وأضفه للطرف الأصغر.","En":"Take half the distance and add it to the smaller endpoint."}],"Title":{"Ar":"على خط الأعداد توجد علامتان عند 340 و360. ما العدد الواقع في منتصف المسافة بينهما؟","En":"On a number line, two marks are at 340 and 360. What number is exactly halfway between them?"},"Points":10,"Options":[{"LatexCode":"345","IsCorrect":false,"ErrorType":"incorrect-option","Reason":{"Ar":"345 يبعد 5 عن الأولى و15 عن الثانية.","En":"345 is five from the first and fifteen from the second."}},{"LatexCode":"350","IsCorrect":true,"ErrorType":"","Reason":null},{"LatexCode":"355","IsCorrect":false,"ErrorType":"incorrect-option","Reason":{"Ar":"355 يبعد 15 عن الأولى و5 عن الثانية.","En":"355 is fifteen from the first and five from the second."}},{"LatexCode":"370","IsCorrect":false,"ErrorType":"incorrect-option","Reason":{"Ar":"370 خارج الفترة أصلاً.","En":"370 is outside the interval."}}],"StageId":1,"Question":{"Ar":"على خط الأعداد توجد علامتان عند 340 و360. ما العدد الواقع في منتصف المسافة بينهما؟","En":"On a number line, two marks are at 340 and 360. What number is exactly halfway between them?"},"Solution":{"Idea":{"Ar":"منتصف المسافة هو متوسط الطرفين.","En":"The midpoint is the arithmetic mean of the two endpoints."},"Unit":{"Ar":"بلا وحدة قياس","En":"Dimensionless"},"Steps":[{"Ar":"نحسب المسافة بين العلامتين، وهي عشرون.","En":"Find the distance between the marks, twenty."},{"Ar":"$360-340=20$","En":"$360-340=20$"},{"Ar":"نضيف نصف المسافة إلى الطرف الأصغر فنصل إلى المنتصف.","En":"Add half the distance to the smaller endpoint to reach the midpoint."}],"Result":{"Ar":"$350$","En":"$350$"},"CommonError":{"Ar":"لا تستعمل نصف المسافة وحده بوصفه إحداثي المنتصف.","En":"Do not use half the distance alone as the midpoint coordinate."},"FormulaLatex":"m=a+(b-a)/2","Substitution":{"Ar":"$340+20/2=350$","En":"$340+20/2=350$"},"Verification":{"Ar":"$350-340=360-350=10$","En":"$350-340=360-350=10$"}},"TrackIds":[3],"CategoryId":81,"PrimarySkillId":304,"DifficultyLevel":1,"SecondarySkillIds":[]}$mw$::jsonb,$mw${"DifficultyLevel":1,"Hints":[{"Ar":"العدد المطلوب يبعد المسافة نفسها عن الطرفين.","En":"The desired number is equally far from both endpoints."},{"Ar":"احسب نصف المسافة وأضفه للطرف الأصغر.","En":"Take half the distance and add it to the smaller endpoint."}],"Solution":{"Idea":{"Ar":"منتصف المسافة هو متوسط الطرفين.","En":"The midpoint is the arithmetic mean of the two endpoints."},"Unit":{"Ar":"بلا وحدة قياس","En":"Dimensionless"},"Steps":[{"Ar":"نحسب المسافة بين العلامتين، وهي عشرون.","En":"Find the distance between the marks, twenty."},{"Ar":"$360-340=20$","En":"$360-340=20$"},{"Ar":"نضيف نصف المسافة إلى الطرف الأصغر فنصل إلى المنتصف.","En":"Add half the distance to the smaller endpoint to reach the midpoint."}],"Result":{"Ar":"$350$","En":"$350$"},"CommonError":{"Ar":"لا تستعمل نصف المسافة وحده بوصفه إحداثي المنتصف.","En":"Do not use half the distance alone as the midpoint coordinate."},"FormulaLatex":"m=a+(b-a)/2","Substitution":{"Ar":"$340+20/2=350$","En":"$340+20/2=350$"},"Verification":{"Ar":"$350-340=360-350=10$","En":"$350-340=360-350=10$"}},"Distractors":[{"ErrorType":"incorrect-option","Reason":{"Ar":"345 يبعد 5 عن الأولى و15 عن الثانية.","En":"345 is five from the first and fifteen from the second."},"Order":1},{"ErrorType":"","Reason":null,"Order":2},{"ErrorType":"incorrect-option","Reason":{"Ar":"355 يبعد 15 عن الأولى و5 عن الثانية.","En":"355 is fifteen from the first and five from the second."},"Order":3},{"ErrorType":"incorrect-option","Reason":{"Ar":"370 خارج الفترة أصلاً.","En":"370 is outside the interval."},"Order":4}]}$mw$,$mw$منتصف المسافة هو متوسط الطرفين.

$m=a+(b-a)/2$

1. نحسب المسافة بين العلامتين، وهي عشرون.

2. $360-340=20$

3. نضيف نصف المسافة إلى الطرف الأصغر فنصل إلى المنتصف.

$340+20/2=350$

$350$ بلا وحدة قياس

$350-340=360-350=10$

لا تستعمل نصف المسافة وحده بوصفه إحداثي المنتصف.$mw$,$mw$The midpoint is the arithmetic mean of the two endpoints.

$m=a+(b-a)/2$

1. Find the distance between the marks, twenty.

2. $360-340=20$

3. Add half the distance to the smaller endpoint to reach the midpoint.

$340+20/2=350$

$350$ Dimensionless

$350-340=360-350=10$

Do not use half the distance alone as the midpoint coordinate.$mw$),
